              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">An artillery unit is made of one Cannon or Organ Gun and 3 crew. It costs 82 pts and you may add up to 3 additional crew for +10 each. The crew have hand weapon and may have light armour (+2). The number of Cannons may not exceed the number of Organ Guns.</characteristic>
